    "text_section_2": {
      "_uid": "0228bd16-7c71-4f77-bdbc-9ab9774517dc",
      "text_markdown": "Where period footage was lost, Golden Wings reconstructs it with synthetic media and says so on screen. Every person you see in the film is real. Every reconstruction is labelled.",
      "align": "",
      "theme": "cream",
      "eyebrow": "Synopsis",
      "heading": "About the footage",
      "component": "text-section",
      "divider_top": "",
      "heading_style": ""
    },
    "text_section_3": {
      "_uid": "023ba5ac-b4b7-4503-ac4e-4356ed5e46fd",
      "text_markdown": "The flight attendant at the center of the award-winning documentary joins its feature expansion with a producer credit she has already earned.",
      "align": "",
      "aside": "Gwingz Studios today announced that Robyn Stewart, an American Airlines flight attendant since 1971, has been named Legacy Producer on *Golden Wings: Stewardess to Sky Queen*, the feature-length expansion of the award-winning documentary short about her career and her family's three generations in commercial aviation.\n\nThe credit is not a courtesy. Stewart located Jock Bethune, the longtime \"voice of American Airlines\" who worked alongside her father on the 747 training program, and brought him to the film. She pointed the production toward Millie Alford, founder of the American Airlines Stewardess College, where Stewart herself trained in 1971.",
      "theme": "slate",
      "badges": "Legacy Producer, 55 years, Since 1971",
      "eyebrow": "Press release · DFW, Texas",
      "heading": "Robyn Stewart named Legacy Producer",
      "component": "text-section",
      "divider_top": "",
      "heading_level": "",
      "heading_style": "",
      "background_image": {
        "id": 227615899794384,
        "alt": "",
        "name": "",
        "focus": "",
        "title": "",
        "source": "",
        "filename": "https://a.storyblok.com/f/295612352463495/1024x1024/5ee6c2880a/gwssq_walk_of_fame.png",
        "copyright": "",
        "fieldtype": "asset",
        "meta_data": {},
        "is_external_url": false
      }
    },
    "quotes_1": {
      "_uid": "d59f9cd8-2bf2-46da-b89f-d5ac781ed7f7",
      "items": [
        {
          "by": "Caleb Mills Stewart, Director",
          "_uid": "a29f65af-2f96-4146-8f38-e8c3c5684a7f",
          "text": "When she said 'you should talk to Jock,' she was not making a suggestion, she was producing. The credit just makes it official.",
          "component": "quote"
        },
        {
          "by": "Robyn Stewart, Legacy Producer",
          "_uid": "7e413b86-50c0-4be1-9600-f3c41ac51f69",
          "text": "Fifty-five years and I still get on the airplane. Millie Alford pinned wings on girls like me and sent us out into the world. Jock worked beside my father. I have been carrying these people with me my whole career. Now they get to be on screen, and I get a say in how.",
          "component": "quote"
        }
      ],
      "theme": "slate",
      "component": "quotes"
    },
    "credits_1": {
      "_uid": "2deb9100-230f-4050-a8bb-8480b156f008",
      "crew": [
        {
          "_uid": "fed32916-3cf0-41a0-8ba9-da97323daab6",
          "name": "Caleb Mills Stewart",
          "role": "Director",
          "component": "credit-row"
        },
        {
          "_uid": "ecb2bcda-b4be-4846-ace0-18a6cd396ab9",
          "name": "Robyn Stewart",
          "role": "Legacy Producer",
